  "body": "Call 021 185 6188 AMBER to make an appointment to view anytime or come to our Open Home at 9 Irwin Lane Sat 11am-12pm.\r\n\r\nBrand-New 3/4 Bed + Study | 3 Bath | 159–163m² | Rangitoto & Westlake Girls’ Zone \r\n\r\nWelcome to Milenio – a new master-planned community in Mairangi Bay/Rosedale, North Shore. \r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to purchase directly from the developer, buy with confidence and secure your home at an unbeatable price. We have freehold, architecturally designed townhouses offering:\r\n\r\n• Lot 59-63, 4 bedrooms\r\n• Lot 84-88, 3 bedrooms + study\r\n• 3 bathrooms (incl. master ensuite)\r\n• Internal access garage\r\n• Spacious floor area approx. 159–163m² (incl. balcony)\r\n• Modern designer kitchen\r\n• Open-plan living with great indoor-outdoor flow\r\n\r\nLocated within highly sought-after school zones:\r\n\r\n• Rangitoto College\r\n• Westlake Girls High School\r\n• Murrays Bay Intermediate\r\n• Mairangi Bay School\r\n\r\nMinutes to Mairangi Bay Beach, close to Albany and motorway access.\r\n\r\nFuture stages will integrate residential living with The Milenio Business Park, bringing retail, cafés, hospitality and office space right to your doorstep.\r\n\r\nModern living. Premium school zones. Growing community.\r\nEnquire now — limited homes available, call to make an appointment or come to our Open Homes!",
